Description: Provides tools for specifying, estimating, simulating, and diagnosing
    heterogeneous spatio-temporal dynamic panel data models. The package includes
    utilities for handling spatial dependence structures, temporal dynamics,
    heterogeneous coefficients, and model output summaries.
